# Ildizdagi build konteksti faqat `deploy/Dockerfile.web` uchun ishlatiladi
# (SPA + nginx). Unga kerak bo'lgani — `frontend/` va `deploy/nginx/`.
# Qolgani kontekstga tushmasin: `backend/venv` va `node_modules` bilan
# birga kontekst yuzlab megabaytga chiqadi va har bir build sekinlashadi.

.git
.github
docs
scripts
backend
*.md
!frontend/**

frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/.env
frontend/.env.*
!frontend/.env.example
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo
frontend/vite.config.js
frontend/vite.config.d.ts

**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.DS_Store
